# =============================================================================
# .gitignore - Experiencing the Anthropocene
#
# Strategy: this repository holds CODE, DOCUMENTATION and FINAL OUTPUTS only
# (PNG figures + CSV tables). Every byte of source and intermediate raster data
# stays local and is re-obtained through the acquisition scripts documented in
# data_sources.md.
#
# The rules below are deliberately blanket rules by EXTENSION rather than by
# path. A path rule only protects the folders that exist today; an extension
# rule also protects the folder someone adds next month. A single 9 GB NetCDF
# committed by accident stays in the history forever, even after deletion.
# =============================================================================

# --- Source data: never committed, re-downloadable (see data_sources.md) ------
data_raw/
**/data_raw/

# --- Heavy geospatial formats, anywhere in the tree --------------------------
# Intermediate rasters live at the data_processed/ root by convention
# (see "Feature explorations/CLAUDE.md"): computational plumbing, not deliverables.
*.nc
*.nc4
*.tif
*.tiff
*.aux.xml
*.vrt
*.gpkg
*.asc
*.tpk
*.zip
*.7z
*.gz
*.grib
*.grb

# Exception: small shared reference grid, needed by several scripts (0.7 MB,
# GHSL-derived, CC-BY 4.0 - redistributable).
!Feature explorations/_shared/pop2020_0p1deg.tif

# --- Internal working documents ----------------------------------------------
# Word/Excel working documents carry tracked changes and named collaborator
# comments; literature PDFs are third-party copyright. None of it belongs in a
# public repository.
*.docx
*.doc
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.pptx
*.pdf
Reading/

# --- Vendored dependency trees (replaced by renv.lock / requirements.txt) -----
.python_packages/
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- renv: lockfile is committed, the library is not -------------------------
renv/library/
renv/local/
renv/cellar/
renv/staging/
renv/python/
renv/sandbox/

# --- R / RStudio session litter ----------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/
Rplots.pdf

# --- QGIS --------------------------------------------------------------------
*.qgz
*.qgs~
qgis_log.txt

# --- Credentials: read at runtime from the user's home directory --------------
# (~/.cdsapirc for Copernicus CDS/ADS). Belt and braces in case a copy lands here.
.cdsapirc
.Renviron
*.key
*.pem
.env

# --- OS / editor --------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~
.claude/
.codex-tmp/
